{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "anchor": "notification-for-backup-schedulers",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Notification for Backup Schedulers"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "introduction",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "1. Introduction"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "introduction",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "When using the backup schedulers, you can receive email notifications when certain actions occur—like when a remote snapshot is created or deleted by the scheduler. This guide explains:"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "introduction",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "What types of notifications are supported"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "introduction",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "How and when they are triggered"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "introduction",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "How to correctly configure your API requests"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "notification-types",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "2. Notification Types"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "notification-types",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Name"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "notification-types",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Description"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "notification-types",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "backup_scheduler_creation"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "notification-types",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Sent when the backup schedulers successfully creates a remote snapshot or local snapshot item."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "notification-types",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "backup_scheduler_deletion"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "notification-types",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Sent when the backup schedulers deletes a remote snapshot or local snapshot, due to retention policies automated cleanup actions."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "default-behavior-preferences",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "3. Default Behavior & Preferences"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "default-behavior-preferences",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Notifications are delivered via email."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "default-behavior-preferences",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Notification preferences are disabled by default for all new users with account status REGULAR or INACTIVE."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "default-behavior-preferences",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Warning"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "default-behavior-preferences",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Even with the correct API fields, notifications will not be sent if the user has disabled them in their preferences."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "default-behavior-preferences",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "More information about how to configure them can be found in:"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "default-behavior-preferences",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Notification Preferences"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "default-behavior-preferences",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Notification Contacts"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "notification-requirements",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "4. Notification Requirements"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "notification-requirements",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Notification Type"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "notification-requirements",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Required Field in API Payload"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "notification-requirements",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "backup_scheduler_creation"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "notification-requirements",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "enable_backup_policy_notifications: true"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "notification-requirements",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "backup_scheduler_deletion"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "notification-requirements",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "enable_retention_policy_notifications: true"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "notification-requirements",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Note"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "notification-requirements",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "✅ Both fields are set to false by default when creating backupschedulers."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "example-behavior",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "5. Example Behavior"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "example-behavior",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "API Field Values"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "example-behavior",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Notifications Sent"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "example-behavior",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Both flags set to false"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "example-behavior",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "❌ None"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "example-behavior",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Only enable_backup_policy_notifications = true"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "example-behavior",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "✅ Only creation notifications"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "example-behavior",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Only enable_retention_policy_notifications = true"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "example-behavior",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "✅ Only deletion notifications"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "example-behavior",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Both flags set to true"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "example-behavior",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "✅ All notifications"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "how-to-use-this-in-the-api",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "6. How to Use This in the API"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "how-to-use-this-in-the-api",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "When creating or updating a backup schedulers, you can control whether notifications are sent by adjusting the enable flags."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "how-to-use-this-in-the-api",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Here’s an example payload that disables both notifications:"
    },
